rity around these  communications the Foreign Office has  defended sukham saying we pay our  diplomats to be candid in a statement it  said the British public would expect our  ambassadors to provide ministers with an  honest unvarnished assessment of the  politics in their country there's been  no reaction yet from the president but  it will come and how will he react well  it's hard to say one description sir Kim  might have added about Donald Trump is  his unpredictability Ashish Joshi Sky  News
 

